    1 │ export default function Home() {
  > 2 │     return <a href="/about">About</a>;
      │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ }
  
  i An <a> element to another page loads a new document, so the client loses its state.
  
  i Use <Link /> from next/link instead, which navigates on the client and prefetches the page.
  
